Distribution and licensing — Fazıl Irak — 24.10.2026

Project code: GNU GPL version 3 or (at your option) any later version; see LICENSE.
Original authors retain their copyrights, including Idle Foundry for Model F's circuit/RT code.
Fazıl Irak's modifications remain under GPL-3.0-or-later. No exclusive ownership of third-party
algorithms is claimed. Third-party ISC/MIT/Apache/GPL terms are preserved in third_party and
in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt. F EQ also retains the Luftikus MIT attribution.

URW Gothic fonts have their own AGPLv3 licence with a PostScript/PDF document exception;
that exception is not claimed as an application-embedding exception. Their licences and full
original 20200910 source collection accompany the corresponding-source archive. GPLv3/AGPLv3
combined-work permissions are relied on while keeping each part's original licence.

Every binary release is accompanied by exact project sources, Cargo.lock, required dependencies,
build/packaging scripts and notices. Source is available on the same GitHub release without charge.
No closed-source redistribution permission is granted. Preserve licences, offer corresponding
source and document modifications when redistributing covered work. No warranty is provided.
